I've left out both operations requests because this node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. Writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` needs a filesystem capability, and calling `metadata.internal.example` needs an `http-client` import. Adding either would widen the node's authority beyond what the graph grants, and a WASM guest without WASI can't write files anyway. Operations should route those through a node that is granted the matching capability.

